flowchart TD
RunOptimization["**Run Optimization**<br/>
Main entry that configures NSGA2 and orchestrates optimization"]
NSGA2_Algorithm["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>
Population based MOO engine running generations"]
ProductionLineProblem["**Production Line Problem**<br/>
Problem wrapper implementing _evaluate for NSGA2"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>
Six buffer capacities discrete {1-10} supplied to evaluations"]
EvaluateDesign["**Evaluate Design**<br/>
Transforms candidate vector into repeated simulations and aggregates results"]
ParallelPool["**Parallel Pool**<br/>
Optional multiprocessing pool used to parallelize design evaluations"]
RunSimulation["**Run Simulation**<br/>
SimPy based production simulation run with given capacities and seed"]
DelayBuffer["**Delay Buffer**<br/>
Buffer model tracking capacity tokens in transit and ready items"]
Machine["**Machine**<br/>
Event driven machine with failure cycles stats and energy accounting"]
PartGenerator["**Part Generator**<br/>
Produces parts into raw input stream at fixed intervals"]
WipSampler["**WIP Sampler**<br/>
Periodic sampler computing instantaneous work in progress"]
Metrics["**Metrics**<br/>
Computes throughput produced parts and average WIP per run"]
ReturnObjectives["**Return Objectives**<br/>
Mean WIP and negated mean throughput returned to Problem"]
HistoryCollector["**History Collector**<br/>
Collects population history and Pareto candidates from optimization"]
ResultsSaver["**Results Saver**<br/>
Converts final and historical solutions to CSV in results directory"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>
Minimize WIP and maximize throughput"]

RunOptimization --> NSGA2_Algorithm
RunOptimization --> ResultsSaver
